{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00201",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 1.29,
      "end_seconds": 3.68,
      "duration_seconds": 2.39,
      "text": "Good morning. Come in, have a seat."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 4.58,
      "end_seconds": 5.28,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Hello."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 8.92,
      "end_seconds": 11.0,
      "duration_seconds": 2.08,
      "text": "You came on your own today?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 11.99,
      "end_seconds": 14.71,
      "duration_seconds": 2.72,
      "text": "Yes, I managed on my own."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 16.1,
      "end_seconds": 17.53,
      "duration_seconds": 1.43,
      "text": "What's been bothering you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 20.43,
      "end_seconds": 29.73,
      "duration_seconds": 9.3,
      "text": "It's pain in my lower back. I thought I'd wait, you know, but it hasn't gone. It's the not knowing that gets to me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 30.12,
      "end_seconds": 33.3,
      "duration_seconds": 3.18,
      "text": "Is this recent, or has it been a while?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 33.77,
      "end_seconds": 41.69,
      "duration_seconds": 7.92,
      "text": "For five days, I'd say. I'd rather know what's going on than keep guessing. I've never really been one for hospitals."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 42.02,
      "end_seconds": 50.47,
      "duration_seconds": 8.45,
      "text": "I see. Tell me a bit more about it: how bad it gets, how often, and whether anything makes it better or worse."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 50.93,
      "end_seconds": 61.05,
      "duration_seconds": 10.12,
      "text": "I'd give it a three, out of ten. Bending definitely sets it off. I'm not great at remembering details, so bear with me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 62.36,
      "end_seconds": 64.53,
      "duration_seconds": 2.17,
      "text": "Does it come along with anything else?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 66.74,
      "end_seconds": 73.08,
      "duration_seconds": 6.34,
      "text": "I mean, when it starts I tend to get difficulty bending forward as well."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 73.63,
      "end_seconds": 78.02,
      "duration_seconds": 4.39,
      "text": "Let me check a few things. Any weight loss or numbness around the groin?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 78.46,
      "end_seconds": 83.7,
      "duration_seconds": 5.24,
      "text": "Uh, no weight loss or numbness around the groin, none of it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 84.75,
      "end_seconds": 88.63,
      "duration_seconds": 3.88,
      "text": "Do you have any allergies to medicines, food, anything at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 89.48,
      "end_seconds": 90.38,
      "duration_seconds": 0.9,
      "text": "No allergies."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 91.3,
      "end_seconds": 92.31,
      "duration_seconds": 1.01,
      "text": "What about alcohol?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 92.76,
      "end_seconds": 96.83,
      "duration_seconds": 4.07,
      "text": "I have a couple of drinks on the weekend."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 98.07,
      "end_seconds": 100.22,
      "duration_seconds": 2.15,
      "text": "Are you on any regular medication?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 100.94,
      "end_seconds": 103.35,
      "duration_seconds": 2.41,
      "text": "No, I don't take anything regularly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 104.4,
      "end_seconds": 107.66,
      "duration_seconds": 3.26,
      "text": "So, one moment, the system's being slow today."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 108.09,
      "end_seconds": 108.84,
      "duration_seconds": 0.75,
      "text": "That's alright."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 115.88,
      "end_seconds": 119.4,
      "duration_seconds": 3.52,
      "text": "Alright, I've got it. What about operations, anything like that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 120.77,
      "end_seconds": 125.41,
      "duration_seconds": 4.64,
      "text": "Well, I had my appendix out about eight years ago."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 127.0,
      "end_seconds": 131.84,
      "duration_seconds": 4.84,
      "text": "Is there anyone at home who can help you out if you need it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 133.2,
      "end_seconds": 142.88,
      "duration_seconds": 9.68,
      "text": "Yes, there's family around most evenings, and they've been very good about checking in, although they do worry more than they need to."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 144.05,
      "end_seconds": 146.72,
      "duration_seconds": 2.67,
      "text": "Any medical conditions, anything you've been treated for?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 148.0,
      "end_seconds": 150.89,
      "duration_seconds": 2.89,
      "text": "Oh, no, I've never had anything serious."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 151.36,
      "end_seconds": 153.27,
      "duration_seconds": 1.91,
      "text": "I'll take a few measurements first."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 167.04,
      "end_seconds": 168.84,
      "duration_seconds": 1.8,
      "text": "Okay, give me a moment..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 180.77,
      "end_seconds": 187.26,
      "duration_seconds": 6.49,
      "text": "Okay: pulse is 80 beats a minute, blood pressure 120 over 74, temperature 36.8, respiratory rate 16."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 188.48,
      "end_seconds": 189.7,
      "duration_seconds": 1.22,
      "text": "Is that normal?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 190.88,
      "end_seconds": 193.9,
      "duration_seconds": 3.02,
      "text": "We'll put it in context in a moment."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 195.24,
      "end_seconds": 198.63,
      "duration_seconds": 3.39,
      "text": "I'll examine you now, so please bear with me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 200.08,
      "end_seconds": 203.5,
      "duration_seconds": 3.42,
      "text": "Right, a little pressure here, tell me if it's tender."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 213.76,
      "end_seconds": 219.54,
      "duration_seconds": 5.78,
      "text": "Straight leg raise is negative on both sides and power in the legs is normal."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 221.48,
      "end_seconds": 223.33,
      "duration_seconds": 1.85,
      "text": "Just relax, I'll be quick."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 233.75,
      "end_seconds": 237.57,
      "duration_seconds": 3.82,
      "text": "There's tenderness over the muscles on the right of the lower back."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 241.47,
      "end_seconds": 251.73,
      "duration_seconds": 10.26,
      "text": "Okay, you can sit back up. Thank you for that. I'll write up what I found in a moment, and then I'll tell you what I think is going on."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 252.65,
      "end_seconds": 256.7,
      "duration_seconds": 4.05,
      "text": "Bear with me, I need to finish this line in the notes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 274.3,
      "end_seconds": 291.58,
      "duration_seconds": 17.28,
      "text": "Good, where were we. From what you've told me and what I found, my working impression is mechanical low back pain. Let me just recap so I've got it right. You've had pain in your lower back for five days, and no numbness around the groin or weight loss."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 292.5,
      "end_seconds": 293.72,
      "duration_seconds": 1.22,
      "text": "Yes, that's right."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 294.45,
      "end_seconds": 307.8,
      "duration_seconds": 13.35,
      "text": "Let's get an MRI of the lumbar spine, for persistent back pain. Let's use ibuprofen, 400 milligrams, twice a day after food, for five days. That's for back pain. It's a commonly used medicine and most people tolerate it well."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 309.2,
      "end_seconds": 310.78,
      "duration_seconds": 1.58,
      "text": "Right, I'll remember that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 313.7,
      "end_seconds": 326.43,
      "duration_seconds": 12.73,
      "text": "Staying gently active heals back pain faster than bed rest, so keep moving. Try to get to bed and wake up at the same time each day, and keep your phone away from the bed. We'll refer you to physiotherapy."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 327.33,
      "end_seconds": 328.03,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Okay."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 328.64,
      "end_seconds": 340.18,
      "duration_seconds": 11.54,
      "text": "If you get numbness in the groin or lose bladder control, or you feel really unwell, please don't wait, come to the emergency department. Please come and see me in three weeks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 341.14,
      "end_seconds": 341.84,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Alright."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 342.22,
      "end_seconds": 349.24,
      "duration_seconds": 7.02,
      "text": "Just so I know I've explained it clearly, can you tell me the plan back in your own words?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 350.39,
      "end_seconds": 359.15,
      "duration_seconds": 8.76,
      "text": "So, I take the ibuprofen, 400 milligrams, twice a day after food and come back in three weeks. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 359.61,
      "end_seconds": 365.61,
      "duration_seconds": 6.0,
      "text": "Yes, exactly right. Right, that's all I have. Is there anything you wanted to ask?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0052",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 367.13,
      "end_seconds": 371.42,
      "duration_seconds": 4.29,
      "text": "I, I think that's clear. Thank you for being so thorough."
    }
  ]
}